== Effects ==
* Reveals the whole map, including the {{r|Secret Room}} and the {{r|Super Secret Room}}. 

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} Does not reveal the {{r|Ultra Secret Room}}.{{dlc-}}
* Will not remove {{cu|Lost}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Book of Secrets|r}}: The mapping provided by '''Ansuz''' counts as one mapping effect. After using '''Ansuz''', the {{i|X-Ray Vision}} effect can be activated by using the Book of Secrets three times instead of four.

